    // Mapping to Halide coordinates: i -> y, j -> x, A[i][j] -> A_prev_param(x, y).
    //
    // We build a *single* Func that:
    //   - applies the 3x3 stencil on interior points, and
    //   - leaves the boundary points unchanged (copied from A_prev_param).
